  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f4e8ce304d58fe9",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Quick Automate 构建端到端的信息征询（RFI）问卷工作流，解决各种规模的组织都会面临的挑战。一家典型的企业每年可能要处理数百份 RFI 问卷，每份问卷都是一个复杂的多工作表工作簿，其中包含层级化的问题集、类别元数据和多种回答类型。这些文档的数量、多样性和复杂性带来了重大的运营挑战。手动提取、整理和解答 RFI 问题需要反复协调，会延迟回复，而且每次问卷格式发生变化时，都可能引入错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ef70929c542bcb0",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick Automate 为其支持的企业流程提供多智能体自动化，这些流程可以跨越部门、系统、UI 和 API 交互以及第三方系统。它使用一组智能体来简化业务流程管理，并降低维护开销。您只需用自然语言描述处理目标，Quick Automate 就能生成涵盖数据摄取、转换、验证和输出的可执行工作流。您可以通过对话完善工作流，使用自己的数据运行它，并将经过验证的版本推广到不同的 AWS Regions。这种方法可以帮助您更快地回复 RFI，并减少格式不一致和错误。该自动化方案旨在随工作负载扩展，您可以通过更新自然语言指令，让它适应新的问卷格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abbf1fb8060996f8",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将向您展示如何构建端到端的自动化流程，从 Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 读取多工作表 RFI 工作簿，提取问卷数据并将其结构化，然后将整理后的输出写回 Amazon S3。本教程使用 Amazon Quick Automate 和 Amazon S3。有关费用详情，请参阅 Amazon Quick 定价和 Amazon S3 定价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17959f991c85a9b0",
      "translationZh": "本演练将自动处理存储在 Amazon S3 中的 RFI 工作簿。采购团队收到 RFI 问卷后，需要提取每个问题，并保留其类别和回答类型。目标是生成一个结构化数据集，供下游团队使用、解读并据此采取行动。在本示例中，我们介绍了一种使用 Amazon Quick Automate 自动执行此流程的解决方案。首先，将 Amazon Quick Automate 连接到存储 RFI 工作簿的 Amazon S3 存储桶。然后创建一个自动化项目，在其中选择数据连接器并组织工作流。项目就绪后，您可以用自然语言描述处理逻辑：读取什么、如何将其结构化，以及将输出写入何处。最终得到的是一个可运行的自动化流程，它会读取多工作表 RFI 工作簿，提取问卷数据并将其结构化，然后输出一个整理好的逗号分隔值（CSV）文件。对于常见场景，这一过程无需编写自定义代码。下图展示了步骤的总体顺序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a161b259669e126",
      "translationZh": "图 1：RFI 工作簿自动化的总体步骤顺序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cdcbfbec8f529e0",
      "translationZh": "该图展示了从连接数据源到将完成的自动化流程部署到生产环境的全过程。请查看 AWS Regions 页面，了解最新的可用情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d13de464164932ad",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案遵循以下步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c332182134b8cdb7",
      "translationZh": "设置 Amazon S3 操作连接器——将 Amazon Quick Automate 连接到您的 S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ab38cd2340e69f9",
      "translationZh": "将 S3 集成添加到自动化组——将 S3 操作共享给将使用它的自动化组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd182e8b0013010f",
      "translationZh": "创建自动化项目——创建用于描述处理逻辑的项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75f4e359b076cbbd",
      "translationZh": "描述处理逻辑——输入自然语言提示，让生成式 AI 助手构建工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b80becb0d5a5a8a8",
      "translationZh": "通过对话进行完善——请求有针对性的更改，迭代完善生成的工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "430064bc4d6ab71b",
      "translationZh": "验证结果——运行工作流，并在您的预生产（开发）AWS 账户中验证输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "847180ffb7626a03",
      "translationZh": "通过 Import/Export 推进到生产环境——导出已验证的版本，并将其导入您的生产账户或目标 AWS 区域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86c6d8d4dc181535",
      "translationZh": "现在我们已经回顾了解决方案的总体步骤，接下来将介绍环境要求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9494c21d2ec9a16b",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，请确认您的环境满足以下要求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bcb02c42205063fc",
      "translationZh": "拥有 Amazon Quick Automate 访问权限的 Amazon Quick Enterprise 订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c86c2e9ff420925",
      "translationZh": "与 Amazon Quick 应用程序位于同一 AWS Region 的 Amazon S3 存储桶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb78e9cc5b1a23ff",
      "translationZh": "熟悉 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 角色和策略。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7684e7ce32198914",
      "translationZh": "对 Amazon S3 存储桶、前缀和对象有基本了解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4322ae2e625c9878",
      "translationZh": "本演练的 IAM 基础配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1584d2822e177971",
      "translationZh": "您需要一个 IAM 角色，授予 Amazon Quick Automate 访问您的 S3 存储桶的权限。如果您还没有这样的角色，请按照以下说明立即创建：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "426eacde2c313b52",
      "translationZh": "打开 IAM 控制台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b4f38e92a8b1fa5",
      "translationZh": "在导航窗格中，选择“角色”，然后选择“创建角色”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11255a0e305947ac",
      "translationZh": "对于受信任实体类型，选择自定义信任策略，并粘贴以下信任策略：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c85f314a4374b46",
      "translationZh": "选择下一步，并附加一个权限策略，授予对目标存储桶的 s3:GetObject、s3:PutObject 和 s3:ListBucket 权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5792601a4539e6df",
      "translationZh": "为角色命名（例如 QuickAutomate-S3-Role），并选择创建角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4927239b5414a2d",
      "translationZh": "复制角色的 Amazon 资源名称（ARN）。配置 S3 连接器时，你将需要它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13621d6c10cf8215",
      "translationZh": "创建 IAM 角色并复制角色 ARN 后，你就可以配置 Amazon Quick Automate 与 S3 存储桶之间的连接了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "27a684aa50a78713",
      "translationZh": "设置 S3 连接器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d2ae98dbe6340b6",
      "translationZh": "确认满足先决条件后，在 Amazon Quick 控制台中配置 S3 连接器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f052b30a30e62bc",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 控制台中，选择右上角的用户图标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd3da6c734ded1fb",
      "translationZh": "打开 Manage Account，然后前往 Permissions > AWS Actions。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2358f4890af8456",
      "translationZh": "图 2：Amazon Quick 控制台中的 AWS Actions 页面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "110d76d8de1e45e5",
      "translationZh": "选择 New action，然后选择 Amazon S3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5686c58cd6a73a1f",
      "translationZh": "配置连接器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ed3f4a4c9aa8cd3",
      "translationZh": "输入连接器名称（例如 ExampleBucket-S3-Connection）和描述。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5ae22255a4c2d32",
      "translationZh": "粘贴你在先决条件步骤中创建的 IAM 角色的 ARN。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d036dbe3b4356ac",
      "translationZh": "图 3：Amazon S3 操作连接器配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae226e06c8d9d528",
      "translationZh": "控制台会自动验证角色信任策略。确认状态显示连接成功。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f07f0f74a0ca6186",
      "translationZh": "将连接器共享给构建和运行工作流的用户及群组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "34426b8f5c98c4e4",
      "translationZh": "创建自动化组",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d546542326dbe47d",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 控制台中，转到“自动化”>“创建组”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f76ffe360457d7fe",
      "translationZh": "图 4：自动化页面上的“创建组”选项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25ff00008f7358ab",
      "translationZh": "为该组命名（例如，RFI-Processing-Group）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fe9deeb404e6b36",
      "translationZh": "在“添加操作”页面上，选择之前创建的 Amazon S3 连接，然后选择“下一步”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f7f95b274cdfe65",
      "translationZh": "图 5：为自动化组选择 Amazon S3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a958759b9e003baa",
      "translationZh": "配置好连接器和自动化组后，创建用于容纳工作流的自动化项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cdbab222852daa9c",
      "translationZh": "创建自动化项目",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d1908ff2012b341",
      "translationZh": "自动化项目是你描述处理逻辑的地方，也是生成的工作流所在的位置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6cd42c93fd92e9b0",
      "translationZh": "在“自动化”页面上，选择“项目”选项卡，然后选择“创建项目”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a441822db8defcd",
      "translationZh": "在“提供项目详情”中，输入项目名称，选择你创建的自动化组，还可以选择添加描述并上传现有文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d0f2441734dbc2e3",
      "translationZh": "选择“下一步：业务论证”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5252cd607d679618",
      "translationZh": "业务论证部分为可选项，用于跟踪投资回报。要完成此部分，请输入每个案例节省的小时数、每年的案例数、项目优先级和目标上线日期。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4613e30c170b51ef",
      "translationZh": "项目会在摘要页面中打开，其中包含“摘要”、“版本”和“部署”选项卡，以及显示项目当前状态的状态面板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce9c2f56fd9844fc",
      "translationZh": "连接器、自动化组和项目都准备就绪后，你就可以开始描述工作流逻辑了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac6bdfe3f767153e",
      "translationZh": "用自然语言描述处理逻辑",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e378a126e99f8c5e",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick Automate 中，你可以用自然语言描述自动化应执行的操作。你可以直接在提示词区域输入，也可以上传包含需求的文件。AI 助手会理解你的指令，并生成可执行的工作流步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a7a57d1f3696b687",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：连接到 S3 并读取工作表",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa939926eab79803",
      "translationZh": "在自动化项目中，你会看到一个用于描述处理需求的文本区域。输入一段提示词，涵盖数据源、转换逻辑以及你希望得到的输出。例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ee5685d6e5fa4a0",
      "translationZh": "“使用 ExampleBucket-S3-Connection 连接器连接到我的 S3 存储桶。从 sample-folder 前缀下读取文件 SampleDepartment_Version2.xlsx。打开 Strategy 工作表并提取所有调查问题。根据编号和缩进识别主问题和子问题。将数据组织为包含序号、类别、问题和回答类型列的结构。将输出以 CSV 文件的形式写入同一存储桶中的 output-folder 前缀下。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9227ed5c296ff008",
      "translationZh": "图 6：在自动化项目中输入处理提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "05978b370825fcd8",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：审查生成的工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7208120f884a86f5",
      "translationZh": "提交提示词后，AI 助手会生成一个多步骤工作流。每个步骤都对应你指令中的一部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29e7dc7be9485831",
      "translationZh": "读取数据——连接到 S3，下载工作簿，并读取包含表头的目标工作表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01d2c175fc16403f",
      "translationZh": "提取和转换——根据编号和缩进识别主问题与子问题，并从列标题中提取类别元数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca94b90228bb6790",
      "translationZh": "构建输出结构——通过合并父级上下文，将子问题转换为独立记录。定义输出模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd4bc200a421bd96",
      "translationZh": "写入结果——将结构化输出保存为 CSV 文件，写入指定的 S3 位置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57a763d10640fa19",
      "translationZh": "图 7：生成的多步骤工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fc85c1b7f188d74",
      "translationZh": "由于 AI 助手依赖生成式 AI，因此每次运行时生成的具体步骤和措辞可能有所不同。您看到的工作流可能与此示例略有差异，但它会根据您的指令涵盖相同的逻辑操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "83a464c418c6c078",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：运行并验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8f35a5766266a7c",
      "translationZh": "选择 Run，对您的工作簿执行该工作流。检查输出以确认：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f6690a6f50e92397",
      "translationZh": "提取所有问题（主问题和子问题）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5ea6abe0012c4ed",
      "translationZh": "类别文本与源数据的列标题完全一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c718c0bf078f9622",
      "translationZh": "子问题包含父问题的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a598a3d52cf103a2",
      "translationZh": "回答类型按源数据中的原样保留。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9a4eba367453fa4",
      "translationZh": "图 8：工作流运行输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "013b2c0fecdc40c9",
      "translationZh": "通过对话优化工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddd55d911e6b66e4",
      "translationZh": "当输出需要改进时，使用对话界面请求有针对性的修改。指明具体步骤，并描述预期行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebf7f3639b7f2684",
      "translationZh": "优化提示词示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25fb1c243b913b1a",
      "translationZh": "“读取 Strategy 工作表的步骤也应将列标题采集为元数据。”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "835c8c36a34cca94",
      "translationZh": "“类别字段与源数据的列标题不匹配。请更新提取逻辑，使用完全一致的列标题文本。”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01cb91898d7c972c",
      "translationZh": "“在子问题转换步骤中，将父级上下文合并到问题文本中。”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0db4980c8c7faa2",
      "translationZh": "遵循以下迭代循环：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aee765da7bda049d",
      "translationZh": "识别问题——将输出与你的预期结果进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55d0d60bf1c3b514",
      "translationZh": "请求有针对性的更新——用自然语言描述所需更改，并指出具体步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a6033c8c950f56e",
      "translationZh": "检查更新后的工作流——AI 助手会修改相关步骤，并向你展示更改。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea1d98a4485047b1",
      "translationZh": "重新运行并验证——再次执行，确认问题已修复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72a841c7a8cfcff5",
      "translationZh": "将自动化流程部署到生产环境之前，请遵循以下最佳实践：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64dfd8fbc1e7a373",
      "translationZh": "增量验证——每次改进后都运行并检查输出，而不是一次性进行多项更改。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7893f0f1d3959d29",
      "translationZh": "明确处理边界情况——说明当数据缺失、重复或格式不一致时，工作流应如何运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d1d10cc0f323e20f",
      "translationZh": "使用 Import/Export 将自动化流程部署到目标环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ec63e2f2ec981fe",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick Automate Import/Export 支持将自动化流程从预生产环境受控地部署到生产环境，并支持在不同 AWS Regions 中一致地复用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "390010cd019b930d",
      "translationZh": "打开源自动化流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5b3213755401aaf",
      "translationZh": "为已验证的发布版本选择 Export version。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01635331443979cf",
      "translationZh": "图 9：导出已验证的自动化流程版本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83bec58061f73e1b",
      "translationZh": "复制生成的版本链接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70e09fb185d4e0d9",
      "translationZh": "注意：导出链接会在设定的期限后过期。请及时复制并使用；如果链接已过期，请生成新链接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ed540a77c45ac8b",
      "translationZh": "图 10：生成的导出版本链接",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c5ea3f788f7ca44",
      "translationZh": "在目标账户或 AWS Region 中打开或创建一个 Amazon Quick Automate 项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c096c850060d9f43",
      "translationZh": "选择“导入版本”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d6b25c3ce453ffe",
      "translationZh": "粘贴版本链接，然后选择“开始”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8d38b34da9b43d1",
      "translationZh": "查看版本详细信息并完成导入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "695eada6f661a144",
      "translationZh": "图 11：导入自动化版本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "626fb583a7f5ea08",
      "translationZh": "在目标环境中配置所需的连接器、凭证和部署设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebb2a1ce7e2348a2",
      "translationZh": "图 12：导入后配置目标环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "096aeec6c781bb12",
      "translationZh": "删除自动化项目和自动化组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2c6b0ae590ad93d",
      "translationZh": "如果没有其他工作流使用 S3 连接器，请将其移除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf1aecfe4af9f5ea",
      "translationZh": "当不再需要测试 IAM 角色和测试 S3 对象时，请将其删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d68538d7187c78e6",
      "translationZh": "有关详细的清理指南，请参阅《使用 Amazon Quick Automate》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "381a7166f1f42f35",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，你使用 Amazon Quick Automate 构建了一个端到端自动化流程，用于处理以多工作表 Excel 工作簿形式存储的 RFI 问卷。你通过 Amazon S3 操作连接器连接了数据，用自然语言描述了处理逻辑，通过对话完善了自动化流程，并使用 Import/Export 将其推广到不同的 AWS 账户和区域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f753b28420fc9de",
      "translationZh": "你可以将这种方法扩展到其他业务工作流，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a255a916eaec8bf",
      "translationZh": "智能文档处理（IDP）——从发票、合同或表单中提取结构化数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "571a99e3cd33ea10",
      "translationZh": "报表整合——将包含多个工作表的财务报表合并为统一的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "825a68d012112afb",
      "translationZh": "UI 自动化——将为下游分析提供输入的重复性浏览器任务自动化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33497aa661087fbf",
      "translationZh": "调查数据聚合——将来自多个来源的调查回复整合为单一输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fb2cd8d789fe286",
      "translationZh": "如需了解有关自动化功能、操作连接器和自然语言工作流的更多信息，请参阅 Amazon Quick 文档。访问《Amazon Quick 入门》，立即开始使用 Amazon Quick Automate。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
